THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION
=======================

This project incorporates work from the following MIT-licensed projects.

serl_franka_controllers
-----------------------
https://github.com/rail-berkeley/serl_franka_controllers

The Cartesian impedance control law in
franka_streaming_impedance_controller/src/cartesian_impedance_law.cpp is ported from
serl_franka_controllers, itself derived from franka_ros's
cartesian_impedance_example_controller. It is the same law polymetis runs (torchcontrol
OperationalSpacePD), with the error sign convention flipped and two additions kept from
SERL: a per-axis error clip, and a nullspace term.

Universal Manipulation Interface (UMI)
--------------------------------------
https://github.com/real-stanford/universal_manipulation_interface

The reference generator in
franka_streaming_impedance_controller/src/pose_trajectory_interpolator.cpp is ported from
UMI's PoseTrajectoryInterpolator.
